---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Outdoor Living Landscape"
  description="How Outdoor Living Landscape handles the information you send through this website."
>
  <main>
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">Last updated November 2026.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you use the contact form, we collect the name, email address, phone number, city, and message you enter, along with the page you sent it from and the time you sent it. We don't ask for payment details or other sensitive information.
      </p>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <p>
        We use this information only to reply to your request, such as a quote, a consultation, or a question, and to keep a record of it so we can follow up. We don't sell your information or share it with advertisers.
      </p>

      <h2>Where it goes</h2>
      <p>
        Your message is sent to our business email and saved in a private spreadsheet that only our team can open. These run on Google and on our own automation server.
      </p>

      <h2>Other services we use</h2>
      <p>
        We use Google (Gmail and Google Sheets) and our own automation server to receive and store form submissions. This website is hosted by Cloudflare, which may log basic visit data such as your IP address in order to deliver and protect the site. These services handle your information only to run the site and our business for us.
      </p>

      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site may use privacy-friendly analytics that count visits without cookies and without tracking you across other websites.
      </p>

      <h2>Do Not Track</h2>
      <p>
        Some browsers send a "Do Not Track" signal. This site doesn't track you across other websites, so it works the same whether or not your browser sends that signal.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        If we change this policy, we'll post the new version on this page and update the date at the top.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        To see, correct, or delete the information you sent us, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or call <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
